Within the field of gas storage, separation and purification, there is particular emphasis on optimising the interactions between MOF hosts and the adsorbed substrate molecules, leading to the discovery of new functional materials with higher storage capacities and stronger binding energies. For this reason, visualisation of the guest–host binding interactions involved in the gas adsorption applications is crucial to the understanding of how these materials function, and to identify important potential mechanisms for the sensing and discrimination of guest molecules.
